    KHAZAH_LEADER "夜中に我々の部下を殺す…奇妙な何かの報告がある。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_khazah.rpy:503
translate ja replay_marbella_gang_bj_first_5e120f37:

    # MC @ talk "You think Lord Zanzibat hired someone else?"
    MC @ talk "ザンジバット卿が別の誰かを雇ったと思う？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_khazah.rpy:504
translate ja replay_marbella_gang_bj_first_d1f345dd:

    # KHAZAH_LEADER "Perhaps, but..."
    KHAZAH_LEADER "おそらく、でも…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_khazah.rpy:505
translate ja replay_marbella_gang_bj_first_bf411aaa:

    # KHAZAH_LEADER "The bodies we've found have bites and claw marks, like an animal's."
    KHAZAH_LEADER "見つかった遺体には噛み跡や爪の跡があって、まるで動物のようだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_khazah.rpy:506
translate ja replay_marbella_gang_bj_first_f2e63912:

    # KHAZAH_LEADER "We've found other bodies too, so whatever is doing this isn't targeting only us."
    KHAZAH_LEADER "他の遺体も見つかっているから、何かがこれをやっているとして、我々だけを狙っているわけではない。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_khazah.rpy:507
translate ja replay_marbella_gang_bj_first_75cc0530:

    # KHAZAH_LEADER "Either way, I want the thing gone."
    KHAZAH_LEADER "いずれにせよ、あの化け物を消し去りたい。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_khazah.rpy:508
translate ja replay_marbella_gang_bj_first_b66e3957:

    # MC @ serious "And why would I help you?"
    MC @ serious "そして、なぜ私があなたを助けなければならない？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_khazah.rpy:509
translate ja replay_marbella_gang_bj_first_0ae5e429:

    # MC @ serious "I don't work for the Khazah."
    MC @ serious "私はカザーのために働いていない。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_khazah.rpy:510
translate ja replay_marbella_gang_bj_first_96cd9b8a:

    # KHAZAH_LEADER "True..."
    KHAZAH_LEADER "確かに…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_khazah.rpy:511
translate ja replay_marbella_gang_bj_first_256dd0d8:

    # KHAZAH_LEADER "Should you do it, I would reward you handsomely as a friend of the Khazah."
    KHAZAH_LEADER "もしやってくれるなら、カザーの友人として十分な報酬を支払おう。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_khazah.rpy:512
translate ja replay_marbella_gang_bj_first_313f6d56:

    # MC @ think "How so?"
    MC @ think "具体的には？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_khazah.rpy:513
translate ja replay_marbella_gang_bj_first_8930fa64:

    # KHAZAH_LEADER "Supplies."
    KHAZAH_LEADER "物資。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_khazah.rpy:514
translate ja replay_marbella_gang_bj_first_3c81ac3d:

    # KHAZAH_LEADER "Coin, medicine, food... I could have a package prepared for you."
    KHAZAH_LEADER "コイン、薬、食料… あなたのために荷造りをしておきましょう。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_khazah.rpy:515
translate ja replay_marbella_gang_bj_first_f4435c9a:

    # KHAZAH_LEADER "Adventurers are never short on such things."
    KHAZAH_LEADER "冒険者なら、そんなものには事欠かないでしょうが。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_khazah.rpy:516
translate ja replay_marbella_gang_bj_first_5fc7cc6e:

    # KHAZAH_LEADER "Well... No need to decide now."
    KHAZAH_LEADER "まあ… 今すぐ決める必要はありません。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_khazah.rpy:517
translate ja replay_marbella_gang_bj_first_e7a4eeff:

    # KHAZAH_LEADER "If you kill whatever that thing is, I will reward you all the same."
    KHAZAH_LEADER "あの化物のようなものを倒せば、同じように報酬を支払います。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_khazah.rpy:519
translate ja replay_marbella_gang_bj_first_508789f0:

    # MC @ talk "I shall think on it."
    MC @ talk "考えておきます。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_khazah.rpy:520
translate ja replay_marbella_gang_bj_first_777cb07a:

    # MC "(Those supplies could be useful... Maybe I should look into it.)"
    MC "(あの物資は役に立つかもしれない… 調べてみるべきかも。)"

